{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01377",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 5.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.81,
      "end_seconds": 9.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.39,
      "end_seconds": 25.54,
      "duration_seconds": 15.15,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got pain in my right groin. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.19,
      "end_seconds": 31.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.99,
      "end_seconds": 42.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Hmm, it's naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain. Paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.12,
      "end_seconds": 49.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Did it come on recently? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.62,
      "end_seconds": 61.35,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "I'd say nearly five years. Actually, no, closer to two years. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.22,
      "end_seconds": 72.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Alright, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.88,
      "end_seconds": 96.6,
      "duration_seconds": 21.72,
      "text": "Only rest, and it's not much. I notice it more with walking. It's severe, honestly. Oh, and stiffness in the hip after sitting. Mm, as for stiffness in the hip after sitting, it's moderate, honestly. I get some relief from moving around."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.0,
      "end_seconds": 100.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Any a limp as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.61,
      "end_seconds": 104.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Yeah. Six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.09,
      "end_seconds": 107.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.06,
      "end_seconds": 110.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.18,
      "end_seconds": 115.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Any sign of numbness in the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.34,
      "end_seconds": 122.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, you know, no numbness in the leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.96,
      "end_seconds": 128.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "And what about back pain, fever, fall or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.47,
      "end_seconds": 138.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no back pain, fever, fall or weight loss, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.85,
      "end_seconds": 141.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.69,
      "end_seconds": 146.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.74,
      "end_seconds": 150.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.97,
      "end_seconds": 153.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.49,
      "end_seconds": 158.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.05,
      "end_seconds": 162.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Oh, no, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.05,
      "end_seconds": 177.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.25,
      "end_seconds": 183.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Arthritis in my knees, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.11,
      "end_seconds": 195.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "So, and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.86,
      "end_seconds": 199.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.13,
      "end_seconds": 202.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.81,
      "end_seconds": 208.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.69,
      "end_seconds": 212.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.79,
      "end_seconds": 217.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.67,
      "end_seconds": 223.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.32,
      "end_seconds": 228.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.14,
      "end_seconds": 232.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Right, do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.76,
      "end_seconds": 237.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.83,
      "end_seconds": 242.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.89,
      "end_seconds": 247.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I had a varicose vein procedure last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.78,
      "end_seconds": 259.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.13,
      "end_seconds": 264.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Uh, my cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.41,
      "end_seconds": 268.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.33,
      "end_seconds": 279.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.6,
      "end_seconds": 303.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.44,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.5 degrees, pressure 111 over 76, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse is 79 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.19,
      "end_seconds": 309.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.6,
      "end_seconds": 312.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.98,
      "end_seconds": 325.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Rotation of the right hip is painful and limited compared with the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.86,
      "end_seconds": 328.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.12,
      "end_seconds": 358.08,
      "duration_seconds": 26.96,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards osteoarthritis of the right hip. Bursitis is still possible. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for joint pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll request a hip X-ray, it'll help with hip pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.78,
      "end_seconds": 365.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Oh, how long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.42,
      "end_seconds": 393.78,
      "duration_seconds": 26.36,
      "text": "Keep walking in short regular bursts and use a stick in the opposite hand. Let's get you seen by physiotherapy, I'll arrange the letter. Let's get you seen by the orthopaedic clinic, I'll arrange the letter. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. I'd like you back after the X-ray. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.83,
      "end_seconds": 398.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.83,
      "end_seconds": 400.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}